      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DANCE WITH CARMER (2) hit his peak when third-up last time out, scoring by more than 7m at Newcastle. Aided by another good draw so could go on with the job. RIPP (10) had enough speed to lead from a similar barrier last week and boxed on okay for a midfield finish. This is easier so he is a big chance to return to the winners' list. SMOOTH BUZZ (3) was beaten only 3.5m into third from this barrier two back before he drew wider and was held up when fourth last week. Things should pan out well from his from this draw. Contender. HUTA NZ (9) draws wide but should find this easier than recent attempts and recorded back-to-back placings here in August. LOUIE LOU I NZ (8) draws wide and was a beaten favourite last start but has claims off a midfield finish in a Listed FFA race prior.",
